<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/19/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "\"Board\" means the Board of managers established under subsection 4(1) of the Malayan Railway Provident Fund Ordinance 1952; \"Fund\" means the Malayan Railway Provident Fund established under section 3 of the Malayan Railway Provident Fund Ordinance 1952; \"KTMB\" means Keretapi Tanah Melayu Berhad; \"Minister\" means the Minister for the time being charged with the responsibility for transport. Repeal and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/19/eng@> .
